MODIFICATIONS AND EXTENSIONS
=========================================================================

SCOUT represents substantial modifications and extensions to the original
Zen MCP Server, including but not limited to:

- Complete configuration system redesign using YAML
- Integration of Redis for state management
- Custom tool implementations for business analysis
- Team-based model selection and validation
- Enhanced error handling and retry logic
- Specification-driven development framework (SpecKit)
- Constitution-based governance system

For a complete list of modifications, see docs/legal/MODIFICATIONS.md

